[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0010","text":"哇～……！\n这就是我的演出服吗～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0020","text":"嗯，是专门为爱依做的哦\n怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0030","text":"哎呀～……！\n脑子里除了『好厉害！』之外蹦不出别的词了～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0040","text":"哈哈，也是啊\n突然被问感想的话──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0050","text":"──啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0060","text":"哦，想到什么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0070","text":"嗯！\n白得不得了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0080","text":"哦、哦……！\n确实是啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0090","text":"还有还有～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_11900100_02_0100","text":"好蓝！"}]
